{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/1792","id":1741779882,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz885n0XOq","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1792","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1792.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1792.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/1792","number":1792,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: implements apis for managing headscale policy","user":{"login":"pallabpain","id":5305744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMDU3NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5305744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain","html_url":"https://github.com/pallabpain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pallabpain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Description\r\nHeadscale currently lacks APIs for managing ACLs.\r\nThe only way to manage ACLs is by loading them \r\nfrom a file, and any changes to the policy \r\nrequire reloading the Headscale process. This \r\nlimitation makes it difficult to integrate \r\nHeadscale with other systems via APIs, as \r\nthere is no ACL management available.\r\n\r\nThis commit introduces two APIs allowing you to set the policy.\r\n\r\n### APIs\r\n#### Set ACL Policy\r\n```\r\nPUT /api/v1/policy\r\n```\r\nPayload (Not JSON, so convert to string before invoking the API.)\r\n```\r\n{\"policy\": \"{// This is a comment\\n\\\"groups\\\":{\\\"g1\\\":[\\\"u1\\\",\\\"u2\\\"]},\\\"acls\\\":[]}\"}\r\n```\r\n#### Get ACL Policy\r\n```\r\nGET /api/v1/policy\r\n```\r\nResponse\r\n```\r\n{\"policy\": {\"groups\": {}, \"tags\": {}}}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### CLI\r\n```\r\n→ go run cmd/headscale/headscale.go --config ./config.yaml policy --help\r\nManage the Headscale ACL Policy\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  headscale policy [command]\r\n\r\nAvailable Commands:\r\n  get         Print the current ACL Policy\r\n  set         Updates the ACL Policy\r\n\r\nFlags:\r\n  -h, --help   help for policy\r\n\r\nGlobal Flags:\r\n  -c, --config string   config file (default is /etc/headscale/config.yaml)\r\n      --force           Disable prompts and forces the execution\r\n  -o, --output string   Output format. Empty for human-readable, 'json', 'json-line' or 'yaml'\r\n\r\nUse \"headscale policy [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!-- Please tick if the following things apply. You… -->\r\n\r\n- [x] read the [CONTRIBUTING guidelines](README.md#contributing)\r\n- [x] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [x] added unit tests\r\n- [x] added integration tests\r\n- [x] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n<!-- If applicable, please reference the issue using `Fixes #XXX` and add tests to cover your new code. -->\r\n\r\n### Resolves\r\n* https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/582\r\n","created_at":"2024-02-24T11:39:13Z","updated_at":"2024-09-26T12:27:43Z","closed_at":"2024-07-18T05:38:26Z","merged_at":"2024-07-18T05:38:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"58bd38a609a7e1e142035c282ab0163eadab7876","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/jua